{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47201","headline":"赠智舟三藏 · 怀浦","name":"赠智舟三藏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"壮岁心难伏，师心伏岂难。\n寻常独在院，行坐不离坛。\n岳雪当禅暝，松声入咒寒。\n更因文字外，多把史书看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"怀浦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}